          "suggestion": null,
          "fixable": false,
          "help": "Generate the file from a Nix value: `(pkgs.formats.json { }).generate \"config.json\" { ... }`. Interpolated values are then quoted and escaped, and the file is always well formed. `pkgs.formats` has json, yaml, toml and ini; `lib.generators` has more."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
